采集 COPP 拓扑 0x10018001（app_type 69938 解析出的那个）在 DSP 侧
开流成功但数据全零；换成 69948（解析到 0x10010315）后实测正常。

A/B 证据（内核 auddbg_tx_topo 强制覆盖）：
- 69938 + 0x10018001 -> 静音
- 69938 + 0x10010315 -> 有信号
- 69938 + 0x11000003 -> 有信号
- 69937 / 69948 -> 0x10010315 -> 有信号

详见 TB-J716F/MIC-ROOTCAUSE-batch16.md
---
 audio/audio_io_policy.conf | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/audio/audio_io_policy.conf b/audio/audio_io_policy.conf
index 19562e0..1e9e08d 100644
--- a/audio/audio_io_policy.conf
+++ b/audio/audio_io_policy.conf
@@ -88,7 +88,7 @@ inputs {
     formats AUDIO_FORMAT_PCM_16_BIT
     sampling_rates 8000|16000|32000|48000|88200|96000|176400|192000
     bit_width 16
-    app_type 69938
+    app_type 69948
   }
   record_24bit {
     formats AUDIO_FORMAT_PCM_24_BIT_PACKED|AUDIO_FORMAT_PCM_24_BIT
@@ -107,7 +107,7 @@ inputs {
     formats AUDIO_FORMAT_PCM_16_BIT
     sampling_rates 8000|16000|32000|48000|88200|96000|176400|192000
     bit_width 16
-    app_type 69938
+    app_type 69948
   }
   record_compress_24 {
     flags AUDIO_INPUT_FLAG_COMPRESS
